    "description": "On this kayaking and snorkelling combination experience, you’ll get to enjoy the beauty of Costa Brava’s wild coast. \r\n\r\nYou’ll start with a private transfer from the centre of Barcelona to a beach in Costa Brava. Your water sports guides will then take over and start your kayaking adventure. As you follow your guides through the water, you’ll be shown Costa Brava’s best kayaking spots. \r\n\r\nFrom secret coves to areas with abundant sea life, Costa Brava is suitable for kayakers of all experience levels. You’ll also have the option to go snorkelling, swimming or simply relax and enjoy the views.",
